Deviations from the org file's procedure
  1. guile on PATH is 2.2.7 on this host. Rather than symlink into ~/bin or
     edit bin/keel's shebang (which would break its recorded digest), a
     guile -> /usr/local/bin/guile3 symlink was placed in a session
     scratchpad directory and prepended to PATH for the build and test runs
     only. Nothing outside the repository was modified. Anyone building
     here needs the same shim, or gmake GUILE=guile3 plus a shebang edit.
     Note that the Makefile's unit target calls bare "guile", not $(GUILE),
     so GUILE=guile3 alone is not sufficient on nexus.
  2. .remember/ (Claude session state, mode 700) sits in the working tree.
     It is excluded via .git/info/exclude rather than .gitignore, because
     .gitignore is a tangled file with a recorded digest and editing it
     would fail the Verify section.

